t with  tragedy that you can't even begin to  imagine and right now you can allow all  of this the media the uncertainty the  fear to defeat you or you can allow this  to be at the defining moment in your  life for the greatest success story that  you will ever experience  just as if the United States gets its  act together we do the right thing if we  stop charging things to the credit card  and paying out the country's worst most  abysmal failures we can in will be as  great or greater than we've ever been  [Music]
 

